Night Shift Training

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_NIGHT_SHIFT_TRAINING_desc]
“Hello, hello? Hey you’re doing great! Most people don’t last this long. I mean, you know, they usually move on to other things by now. I’m not implying that they died.”

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_NIGHT_SHIFT_TRAINING]
夜班保安培训

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_NIGHT_SHIFT_TRAINING_desc]
“在么？在么？嘿，你做得很棒！大多数小马都坚持不了这么久！我是说，你知道的，他们通常现在已经转行了。我并不是在暗示他们死了。”

